 dense  ordering it's countable and it  doesn't have any end points and it is  well known that  if you take any order which is downs  countable and has no  end point then it is isomorphic to the  rational numbers so this way  uh you you you get the rational numbers  inside the  radians tree and you can you can use a  raven's theorem to decide that  uh this this particular construction  uses the notion of left and right but as  i mentioned before in my  tutorial you can uh encode the notion of  left and right by  just guessing uh an extra set in ravens  is here  in the raven tree which represents the  left children  uh so this way we can see that using  gradients  theorem we can decide that the mso  theory of rational numbers  there is an alternative method which  does not go through raven's theorem and  was actually  originally proposed in in sherlock's  paper and later developed  by by cartoon  call combined who is using a semi  groups for rational numbers but  instead of automata but i will not go  into that  in fact it's an interesting case because  there is as far as i know there's no  no no known notion of automata  for rational numbers so the the existing  methods they need to avoid this uh  either by going into a richer structure  of trees where you  do have automata or by developing a  semi-group  methods over the rational numbers  themselves  so this this uh this uh this theorem  shows  what are the limits of the automaton  method uh so for for example  for the ordered real numbers the msl  theory is undecidable  and this brings me to the conclusion  of the first part of my tutorial where i  gave you  examples of structures where the first  order theory or the  monadic second order theory were  decidable and  uh my main focus was to uh  choose structures so so that that the  decidability of the theory would follow  from  a translation of formulas into  equivalent  automata and now in the later  second and third parts of my talk i will  discuss  applications of of these methods and  others to to  to the satisfiability problem and also  to the  variant of the model checking problem  where the  formula is fixed thank you  you
 

